{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2022-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1665878400, "end_date": 1666569599, "month_true_total": 111, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:57:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "124300541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018924027", "personaname": "Tact", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018924027/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 569, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 569, "last_played": 1666514923, "avatar": "b6cc84771a90dab7de2cf5faba345f3e85188a1a"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want to play this game, I recommend playing it before the rest of the mass effect series. After completing legendary edition of the regular series, this one is just painful. Everything about it irks me, and after 10h in, I just cant go on", "timestamp_created": 1666568392, "timestamp_updated": 1666568392, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124282291", "author": {"steamid": "76561198383144778", "personaname": "Bucsgnome03", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Bucsgnom0e03/", "num_games_owned": 106, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 100, "playtime_at_review": 147, "last_played": 1790542622, "avatar": "b7e2d441c90020ebef0a7d6457973eb6f32cf844"}, "language": "english", "review": "Outstanding title, I love the trilogy, and this game. Best combat system in the whole franchise, also even better than ME 3s MP(which was wonderful). Bioware thanks for another masterpiece. I'm hope ME:A2 gets un-shelved. <3", "timestamp_created": 1666542436, "timestamp_updated": 1666542436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522471904754638672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124276322", "author": {"steamid": "76561198036263187", "personaname": "Noyes Laboratory", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198036263187/", "num_games_owned": 378, "num_reviews": 101, "playtime_forever": 418, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 280, "last_played": 1716960640, "avatar": "5a1e96242d8bc2fa5e7d9c25fdfe155d88232f3a"}, "language": "english", "review": "actualy gewd", "timestamp_created": 1666535260, "timestamp_updated": 1666535260, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.552021682262420654", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124256074", "author": {"steamid": "76561198975695323", "personaname": "Earthwing", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/earthwing4114/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 4231, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4231, "last_played": 1666503261, "avatar": "3ce1a5c22a121e136de5cf6d390f345d8847065b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wish I could recommend the well written very pretty space game but alas I had to be a colonizer in an EA game as well", "timestamp_created": 1666503330, "timestamp_updated": 1666503330, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.453224867582321167", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "124251052", "author": {"steamid": "76561199189752361", "personaname": "Struggles of Cullen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199189752361/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 18472, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14634, "last_played": 1751452666, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game has a really bad reputation, but that needs to change. Its actually an incredibly fun RPG and although some aspects are clearly rushed/not thought through enough or just products of bad writing, the good stuff does shine through if you jump into it with the intentions of 'lets go to Andromeda baby, I've got this.'\nThe gameplay is insanely fun, with the combo detonators helping you clear massive groups in a couple of seconds. Also you aren't stuck with a limited amount of skills once you start, you can change from biotics to tech, or a mix of everything whenever you like. \nDon't go into this game thinking about the original trilogy, its not like that, and its what ruins it for most people. Its been a great comfort game for me and I've really enjoyed playing it.", "timestamp_created": 1666494058, "timestamp_updated": 1666494058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.559336423873901367", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}